// X-macro list of the config-static flight-shaping fields shared between
// FlightShapingRuntimeInputs (core/mission/runtime/reward_runtime.h) and
// StepEvaluationBatchConfig (core/mission/episode/execution_episode_batch_prepare.h).
//
// Consumers define EF_FLIGHT_SHAPING_FIELD(type, name, default_value) before
// including this file; the macro is #undef'd here after expansion. Expansion
// sites: both struct definitions, the batch-prepare config->inputs copy, and
// the FlightShapingRuntimeInputs Python bindings.
//
// Field order is load-bearing: it fixes the member layout of both structs.
// target_altitude_m / target_speed_mps also exist on both structs but live in
// the mission-dynamic block of FlightShapingRuntimeInputs, so they stay
// hand-written to preserve member order.

